sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Repo as WishlistRepository
    participant SSOT as Room per-account (Ch 3/42)
    participant Out as Outbox (Ch 31)
    participant Srv as Server

    User->>Repo: toggle(productId) save
    Repo->>SSOT: add (accountId, productId) optimistic (Ch 72)
    Note over SSOT: heart flips INSTANTLY everywhere - one row, Ch 3
    Repo->>Out: enqueue Add idempotency key (Ch 31/15)
    Out->>Srv: set membership add idempotent
    alt success
        Srv-->>Out: ok
    else genuine failure
        Out->>SSOT: rollback remove + tell user (Ch 72)
    else transient offline
        Out->>Out: keep + retry on reconnect (Ch 2/29)
    end
